  "definition": "Approval for Delivery of Services",
  "effectiveDate": "2008-01-30",
  "historyNote": "#7058, eff 7-21-99; ss by #8902, INTERIM, eff 7-13-07, EXPIRED: 1-9-08, EXPIRED New. #9082, eff 1-30-08 (from He-A 906.02)",
